{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01U2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\subset X$", "MATH_0004": "$V \\subset S$", "MATH_0005": "$f(U) \\subset V$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_S(V) \\to \\mathcal{O}_X(U)$", "MATH_0007": "$S = \\bigcup_{j \\in J} V_j$", "MATH_0008": "$f^{-1}(V_j) = \\bigcup_{i \\in I_j} U_i$", "MATH_0009": "$U_i \\to V_j$", "MATH_0010": "$j\\in J, i\\in I_j$", "MATH_0011": "$S = \\bigcup_{j \\in J} V_j$", "MATH_0012": "$f^{-1}(V_j) = \\bigcup_{i \\in I_j} U_i$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{O}_S(V_j) \\to \\mathcal{O}_X(U_i)$", "MATH_0014": "$j\\in J, i\\in I_j$", "MATH_0015": "$f$", "MATH_0016": "$U \\subset X$", "MATH_0017": "$V \\subset S$", "MATH_0018": "$f(U) \\subset V$", "MATH_0019": "$f|_U : U \\to V$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-flat-characterize}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:831157cffc4f322e7a359b1d2895997bfe94b41d1a431cf27d30599a8144b2c2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e889f6dd79a3ade77fa675c35323bea9cf217a4069962230dd8f1e1f457dc6b4", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The morphism <MATH_0002> is flat.\n<STRUCT_0003> For every affine opens <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004>\nwith <MATH_0005> the ring map\n<MATH_0006> is flat.\n<STRUCT_0004> There exists an open covering <MATH_0007>\nand open coverings <MATH_0008> such\nthat each of the morphisms <MATH_0009>, <MATH_0010>\nis flat.\n<STRUCT_0005> There exists an affine open covering <MATH_0011>\nand affine open coverings <MATH_0012> such\nthat <MATH_0013> is flat, for all\n<MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0006>\nMoreover, if <MATH_0015> is flat then for\nany open subschemes <MATH_0016>, <MATH_0017> with <MATH_0018>\nthe restriction <MATH_0019> is flat.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7097eeb2a64f3d80d0d5d3b50175aa9e221acac0f2f7fbf16dc06276d82dcbb8", "unit_id": "tag:01U5:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01U2", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-flat-module-characterize}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3c6990ab8e9077deea11547852e77f3cf4cd131ed1e090b652cb6a45228df45a", "source_text": "This is a special case of Lemma <REF_0001>\nabove.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:16473afed334fe9ac8619826a44a00552864e5bc54dd16b8a622a633abca7595", "unit_id": "tag:01U5:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01U2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0006": "$S$", "MATH_0007": "$f_*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$S$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-pushforward-flat-affine}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:61ff628735436a45126e4d6f952a532d999e7ebed0fad98d0293a90a6c6eb337", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:14f8c3fc5aa4051e9d2e08eae20357a3e8525f461038910c4678cb3fd1c8a70f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an affine morphism of schemes over a base scheme <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a quasi-coherent <MATH_0004>-module.\nThen <MATH_0005> is flat over <MATH_0006> if and only if\n<MATH_0007> is flat over <MATH_0008>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c7d5d8d42609e9e962671535c8f49d90328ed8d147b201224090eaf9cfdd55b5", "unit_id": "tag:0FLM:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01U2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$X \\to Y \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$C \\leftarrow B \\leftarrow A$", "MATH_0004": "$N$", "MATH_0005": "$C$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0007": "$f_*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$N$", "MATH_0009": "$B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-flat-module-characterize}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-widetilde-pullback}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:57c6a828a6cd5c92171c97b01460bc5ba540cd5be7045f76ada1b1dda045f2ef", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fae4aa837d0feb22af5a2c2f785b4213d3c1446f2fe75481b43549739808bd2b", "source_text": "By Lemma <REF_0001> and the fact that\n<MATH_0001> is an affine morphism, this reduces us to the affine case.\nSay <MATH_0002> corresponds to the ring maps <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be the <MATH_0005>-module corresponding to <MATH_0006>.\nRecall that <MATH_0007> corresponds to <MATH_0008> viewed as a <MATH_0009>-module, see\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nThus the result is clear.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1b59d90488534e58cd151bda5c9127ba23230412fd93ec23c2036b956825ffdb", "unit_id": "tag:0FLM:proof"}
